{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37457","headline":"萤 · 唐彦谦","name":"萤","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"日下芜城莽苍中，湿萤撩乱起衰丛。\n寒烟陈后长门闭，夜雨隋家旧苑空。\n星散欲陵前槛月，影低如试北窗风。\n羇人此夕方愁绪，心似寒灰首似蓬。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"唐彦谦","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37457.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37457","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}